{"mode":"words","text":"Most hallgasd meg a szöveget, és közben kövesd a szöveget. Kezdőként olvasd el a jelentésmagyarázatot anyanyelveden, hallgasd meg lassan a célnyelvet, és gyakran nyomd meg a szünet gombot — így az agyad összekapcsolja a hangot a jelentéssel. Haladóként olvasd el az eredeti szöveget, és csak az ismeretlen szavaknál pillants le röviden. Használd gyakran az A-B-ismétlést: jelöld ki egy mondatot, és játszd le újra és újra – próbáld ki fent!","words":[{"s":0,"e":267},{"s":313,"e":639},{"s":685,"e":789},{"s":848,"e":871},{"s":906,"e":1579},{"s":1811,"e":1962},{"s":2032,"e":2438},{"s":2531,"e":2949},{"s":2972,"e":2995},{"s":3042,"e":3750},{"s":4017,"e":4644},{"s":4725,"e":5097},{"s":5120,"e":5236},{"s":5329,"e":5375},{"s":5445,"e":6687},{"s":6815,"e":7848},{"s":8162,"e":8522},{"s":8557,"e":8684},{"s":8731,"e":8986},{"s":9056,"e":9079},{"s":9126,"e":9985},{"s":10217,"e":10368},{"s":10414,"e":10856},{"s":10983,"e":11285},{"s":11343,"e":11622},{"s":11773,"e":11889},{"s":11958,"e":12272},{"s":12342,"e":12794},{"s":12945,"e":13085},{"s":13758,"e":13897},{"s":13932,"e":14002},{"s":14072,"e":14373},{"s":14443,"e":15151},{"s":15174,"e":15198},{"s":15267,"e":15592},{"s":15639,"e":15662},{"s":15709,"e":16800},{"s":17113,"e":17810},{"s":17891,"e":18263},{"s":18286,"e":18344},{"s":18390,"e":18460},{"s":18530,"e":18901},{"s":18959,"e":19505},{"s":19540,"e":19668},{"s":19714,"e":19853},{"s":19900,"e":19958},{"s":20004,"e":20527},{"s":20573,"e":21061},{"s":21096,"e":21467},{"s":21537,"e":21606},{"s":21641,"e":22326},{"s":23000,"e":23499},{"s":23522,"e":23952},{"s":24021,"e":24149},{"s":24300,"e":25716},{"s":26146,"e":26483},{"s":26541,"e":26622},{"s":26657,"e":26750},{"s":26785,"e":27481},{"s":27656,"e":27818},{"s":27888,"e":28190},{"s":28213,"e":28306},{"s":28375,"e":28735},{"s":28817,"e":29002},{"s":29118,"e":29548},{"s":29664,"e":29711},{"s":29861,"e":30314},{"s":30372,"e":30454},{"s":30512,"e":31208}]}